ts (e.g. a burst of the same\n  auth error when a session is revoked) show once; migrate all editors and the\n  public contact form off their per-component toasts and providers\n- profile sections now read via a live docData listener (typed) instead of a\n  one-shot getDocFromServer, so About/Contact/Services/Hero reflect admin edits\n  without a reload; clean up the subscriptions with takeUntilDestroyed\n- contact links: drop Instagram, add LeetCode + HackerRank, and render them\n  (plus X) on the public contact section; remove the dead Facebook field\n- footer socials now come from the contact doc instead of being hardcoded\n- services editor: disable Save on an empty list so a blank save can''t report success\n- type ProfileService.saveSectionData/saveProject/updateProject (drop `any`)","tree":{"sha":"de2e891a5674b96e8f7ef7b5e737601f76e903ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/s-banerjee94/my-portfolio-in-angular/git/trees/de2e891a5674b96e8f7ef7b5e737601f76e903ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/s-banerjee94/my-portfolio-in-angular/git/commits/6c0014f93dca2f18db45ecd9d55425de74319e02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20889194?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-banerjee94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-banerjee94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-banerjee94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-banerjee94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/s-banerjee94","id":20889194,"login":"s-banerjee94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODg5MTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-banerjee94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-banerjee94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s-banerjee94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/u